  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">US/DK side-event at CSW68</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the margins of the 58th session of the Commission on the Status of Women Denmark and the United States of Amerika jointly hosted a side-event on the theme &#xbf;The Equal Futures Partnership: Addressing the Impact of Gender-based Violence on Women&#xbf;s Economic and Political Participation&#xbf;. The side-event focused on concrete actions taken by governments and partners in order to address these issues.</narrative>
  </description>
